<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-BALTIKA STARTS NEGOTIATIONS WITH ELINA.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-BALTIKA STARTS NEGOTIATIONS WITH ELINA.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Balitka , a clothing manufacturer and retailer, said on Tuesday that it had started negotiations for a controlling stake in Elina, Estonia's largest women's clothing producer.</p>
<p>Baltika said in a statement that its investment aim was to improve Elina's productivity and increase its sales volume.</p>
<p>Elina's 1997 sales forecast is 25 million kroons and its profit forecast is one million kroons.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
